{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"How one helper source tree becomes two binaries, and how each feature finds out whether it can run.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/helperbuilds"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"HeadwireMacKit"}],"role":"article","title":"The App Store and Direct builds"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuilds"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Headwire Helper ships in two builds from the same code:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The App Store build","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is sandboxed and compiles no private API. It is the default: a plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swift build"},{"type":"text","text":" makes it."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Direct build","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is signed with Developer ID, notarized and unsandboxed. It adds the code compiled under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HEADWIRE_PRIVATE_API"},{"type":"text","text":": the virtual display that extends the Mac onto the device, Apple’s Sidecar started from the menu, and answering the Mac’s side of Bluetooth pairing without a system dialog. Each of these is checked at run time and turns off rather than crashes when macOS has changed it."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helper input is compiled under a second switch, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HEADWIRE_HELPER_INPUT"},{"text":", which is on by default in both builds. A build without it keeps streaming and shows input as unavailable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This documentation is generated from the App Store build, so the Direct build’s private-API types do not appear in it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Which build is running","anchor":"Which-build-is-running","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/current"},{"text":" reads the two compile-time switches and reports the build’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/Distribution-swift.enum"},{"text":" and whether helper input is compiled in. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperBuild\/launchLine(version:dryRun:)"},{"text":" is the first line the helper logs at launch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Whether a feature runs","anchor":"Whether-a-feature-runs","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperFeatures\/resolve(_:grants:build:)"},{"text":" combines three inputs into one ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState"},{"text":" for each feature:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The menu’s switch for it, in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/HelperToggles"},{"type":"text","text":". Every switch starts off: the helper is optional, and streaming, input and extending the Mac begin only when the person turns them on."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What macOS has granted, in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/PermissionGrants"},{"type":"text","text":". A switch that is on without its permission is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/needs(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Onboarding"},{"type":"text","text":" walks the person through that one permission."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the build contains. A feature the build lacks is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/unavailable(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability\/menuText"},{"type":"text","text":" is shown on the greyed-out control."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The extended display also needs streaming, so with its switch on and streaming not running it is ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/needsStreaming"},{"text":". The features go to the device as the helper’s capabilities, so the device greys out the same controls with the same reasons.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/FeatureState/needsStreaming":{"url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/featurestate\/needsstreaming","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/FeatureState\/needsStreaming","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"needsStreaming"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The virtual display’s toggle is on and streaming does not run.","type":"text"}],"title":"FeatureState.needsStreaming","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/Unavailability/menuText":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/unavailability\/menutext","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"menuText","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The words on the greyed-out control.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Unavailability\/menuText","type":"topic","title":"menuText"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/Onboarding":{"title":"Onboarding","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/onboarding","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The permission steps the helper’s menu walks a person through."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Onboarding"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Onboarding"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit\/Onboarding","kind":"symbol"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireMacKit\/documentation\/HeadwireMacKit","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit","title":"HeadwireMacKit","abstract":[{"text":"The decisions Headwire Helper makes on the Mac, as plain value types.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://HeadwireMacKit/documentation/HeadwireMacKit/PermissionGrants":{"title":"PermissionGrants","url":"\/documentation\/headwiremackit\/permissiongra